  "name": "NeuroKit2",
  "description": "Python library for neurophysiological signal processing. Provides accessible, reproducible tools for ECG, EEG, EMG, EDA, and PPG signals — covering cleaning, feature extraction, and analysis. Used in clinical research, wearable device pipelines, and psychophysiology studies.",
