  "mach:judgementReason": "The most accessible and comprehensive Python library for physiological signal processing. 2,200+ stars, MIT license, pip-installable, well-documented with tutorials. Covers ECG, EEG, EMG, EDA, and PPG with a consistent API. Widely used in clinical research and wearable device analysis pipelines. Benchmarked against established tools in peer-reviewed publications.",
